        {
          "text": "Umuntu kaNkulunkulu wamthukuthelela, wathi: “Ngabe ushaye kahlanu noma kasithupha; wanqoba ama-Aramu waze wawaqeda; kodwa manje uzowahlula ama-Aramu kathathu kuphela.",
